{"src":"en","tgt":"ru","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":189600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ru","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9371.313827,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of World Heritage Sites in Danger due to the threat of desert sands."},{"kind":"text","t":10226.968663,"text":"В 1990 году он был включен в список объектов всемирного наследия, находящихся под угрозой, из-за опасности пустынных песков."},{"kind":"audio","t":10450.270419999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10451.677038,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10453.090556,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":10454.692748,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10456.329991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10458.060216,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":10459.763289999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":580,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":10461.314071,"samples":30873,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1150},{"kind":"input","t":18854.870974999998,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":19869.667721,"text":"Если вы смотрели фильм «Национальное сокровище», возможно, вы думаете, что на обратной стороне Декларации независимости была написана карта сокровищ."},{"kind":"audio","t":20062.12824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20063.61436,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20065.382045,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":20066.768493,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20068.396206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20069.987768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":20071.61836,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20072.551179,"samples":20284,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":26831.763837,"text":"Children are placed in foster care for a wide variety of reasons that range from neglect to abuse."},{"kind":"text","t":27512.781511,"text":"Детей помещают в приёмные семьи по самым разным причинам — от пренебрежения до жестокого обращения."},{"kind":"audio","t":27637.812827,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27639.204115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27640.776706,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":27642.46233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":27644.050912,"samples":32489,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1270},{"kind":"input","t":29879.835055,"text":"and even to extortion."},{"kind":"text","t":30076.692222,"text":"и даже для вымогательства."},{"kind":"audio","t":30117.720864,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30117.99634,"samples":10142,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":40779.615461,"text":"Chocamo Valley, Chile's premier climbing destination, known as the Yosemite of South America, with a variety of granite big walls and crags."},{"kind":"text","t":41993.611221,"text":"Долина Чокамо — ведущее место для скалолазания в Чили, известное как «Йосемити Южной Америки» благодаря разнообразию больших гранитных стен и скальных утесов."},{"kind":"audio","t":42193.426277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":42194.868566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":550,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42196.524689,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42198.378405999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42200.014949,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42201.658772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42203.279884999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":42204.931638,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42205.568691,"samples":16216,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":46514.408199,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":47140.93313,"text":"Были приняты взгляды Аристотеля по всем вопросам науки, включая физиологию."},{"kind":"audio","t":47245.965826,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47247.799213,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47249.14838,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":47250.736162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":47250.871535,"samples":4068,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":54279.636095,"text":"If you're not used to driving on country roads, keep your wits about you. Steep grades, narrow lanes, and sharp curves predominate."},{"kind":"text","t":54878.287318,"text":"Если вы не привыкли водить по сельским дорогам, будьте осторожны. Преобладают крутые склоны, узкие тропы и резкие повороты."},{"kind":"audio","t":54978.222081,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54979.575469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":54980.973595999996,"samples":30037,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":55001.194562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55002.512318,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55004.12007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":55004.329525,"samples":8414,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":67474.81557,"text":"The presence of the true invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109, is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"text","t":68506.983944,"text":"Наличие настоящей «невидимой» команды — Ларсона и ЛаФасто, 1989, стр. 109 — также является уникальным элементом виртуальной команды."},{"kind":"audio","t":68687.34676,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68688.604846,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":840},{"kind":"audio","t":68690.21632800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68691.855811,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68693.504994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68695.133507,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68695.595556,"samples":12371,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"audio","t":68697.465823,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"audio","t":68699.094356,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":320,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68700.79986000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68702.249649,"samples":29870,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"input","t":73006.93875500001,"text":"After the accident occurred, Gibson was transported to a hospital but died shortly after."},{"kind":"text","t":73584.62758700001,"text":"После происшествия Гибсон был доставлен в больницу, но вскоре скончался."},{"kind":"audio","t":73705.41502900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73706.73870500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73708.33452700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73709.96989000001,"samples":32099,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"input","t":82776.93957500001,"text":"Many German baked goods feature almonds, hazelnuts, and other tree nuts. Popular cakes often pair particularly well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"text","t":83479.719406,"text":"Многие немецкие выпечки содержат миндаль, фундук и другие орехи. Популярные торты особенно хорошо сочетаются с чашкой крепкого кофе."},{"kind":"audio","t":83605.55862800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83606.88589500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":83608.49051700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83609.71290200001,"samples":25411,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":820},{"kind":"audio","t":83611.47061700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83613.08725000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83614.71009200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83615.054409,"samples":11201,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":310},{"kind":"input","t":90145.872596,"text":"Needless to say, if you know a Romance language, it will be easier for you to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"text","t":90759.09067,"text":"Разумеется, если вы знаете романский язык, вам будет легче выучить португальский."},{"kind":"audio","t":90878.29646000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90879.821551,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":90881.430343,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90882.92058300001,"samples":29591,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"input","t":97823.055076,"text":"The pyramid sound and light show is one of the most interesting things in the area for kids."},{"kind":"text","t":98515.81782600001,"text":"Шоу звуков и светов «Пирамида» — одно из самых интересных развлечений для детей в этом районе."},{"kind":"audio","t":98674.72566200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98676.21483200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98677.89771500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98679.56401900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98680.35885500001,"samples":18278,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":103723.22593100001,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points."},{"kind":"text","t":104545.588568,"text":"Движение транспорта — это наука, изучающая перемещение отдельных водителей и транспортных средств между двумя точками."},{"kind":"audio","t":104723.512266,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104725.046436,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104726.836882,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104728.369483,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104729.985635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104731.638798,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":104732.93562500001,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1020},{"kind":"input","t":106589.687571,"text":"and the interactions they make with one another."},{"kind":"text","t":106862.58553200001,"text":"и взаимодействие между ними."},{"kind":"audio","t":106913.95756200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106914.20965700001,"samples":11256,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":114632.792749,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's"},{"kind":"text","t":115342.18362200001,"text":"Австралиец Митчелл Гоури занял 11-е место в мужском соревновании Super G Четс."},{"kind":"audio","t":115448.476573,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115450.07214500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115451.719578,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115453.368501,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":115453.474363,"samples":2396,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":121625.949548,"text":"competitor Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":122405.068238,"text":"Спортсмен Ульрих Йоклин занял 16-е место в мужском соревновании Super G в сидячем положении."},{"kind":"audio","t":122543.954863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122545.715058,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122547.28214000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122548.882652,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122550.31482000001,"samples":28866,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"input","t":128628.698705,"text":"As referenced, independent studies suggest that Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion unknowingly brought"},{"kind":"text","t":129575.61098000001,"text":"Как упоминалось ранее, независимые исследования показывают, что непальский батальон миротворцев ООН непреднамеренно привёз"},{"kind":"audio","t":129743.862504,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129745.373064,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":560,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129747.00675700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129748.63410900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129750.23038100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":129751.822363,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129752.532448,"samples":17108,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":136526.221019,"text":"Soon after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain initiated a naval blockade of Germany."},{"kind":"text","t":137192.537358,"text":"Вскоре после начала военных действий Великобритания ввела морскую блокаду против Германии."},{"kind":"audio","t":137318.977434,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137320.381792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137321.878182,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137323.546385,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137324.26926,"samples":17442,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":145654.956191,"text":"It also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur such as T-Rex would be no match for it."},{"kind":"text","t":146390.01629899998,"text":"Он также атаковал всё, что попадало в воду. Даже гигантский динозавр вроде тираннозавра не смог бы с ним сравниться."},{"kind":"audio","t":146474.750408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146476.294139,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146476.78171799998,"samples":13597,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":410},{"kind":"audio","t":146503.189288,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146504.81105,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146506.481264,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146507.405172,"samples":20396,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":155034.526475,"text":"The use of video recording has led to important discoveries in the interpretation of microexpressions."},{"kind":"text","t":155678.652069,"text":"Использование видеозаписей привело к важным открытиям в интерпретации микроэкспрессий."},{"kind":"audio","t":155807.90441,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155809.513563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155811.175616,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155812.796138,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155813.209877,"samples":11869,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":159389.752833,"text":"facial movements which last a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"text","t":159793.986178,"text":"движения лица, продолжающиеся несколько миллисекунд."},{"kind":"audio","t":159876.69457599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159878.121725,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159879.734107,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":159879.82858899998,"samples":2284,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":167443.587787,"text":"The announcement was made after Trump had a phone conversation with Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":168225.908111,"text":"Объявление было сделано после телефонного разговора Трампа с президентом Турции Реджепом Тайипом Эрдоганом."},{"kind":"audio","t":168383.33504799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168384.71210499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168386.289597,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":168387.92058,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":168389.529322,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168390.081233,"samples":14489,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":174923.611446,"text":"These are sometimes crowded family beaches with a good range of shops aligning the shore."},{"kind":"text","t":175566.940274,"text":"Это иногда многолюдные семейные пляжи с большим количеством магазинов вдоль берега."},{"kind":"audio","t":175667.436109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175669.171864,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175670.46581999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175672.07621199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":175672.203685,"samples":167,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":177080.07454,"text":"I just want to get safe."},{"kind":"text","t":177321.209164,"text":"Я просто хочу быть в безопасности."},{"kind":"audio","t":177375.03814299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177375.937132,"samples":24352,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"input","t":188440.70055799998,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or associated with France and known as luxury beach resorts."},{"kind":"text","t":189382.053272,"text":"Большинство мелких островов являются независимыми государствами или связаны с Францией и известны как роскошные пляжные курорты."},{"kind":"audio","t":189548.650882,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189550.005149,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189551.589401,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":189553.151082,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189554.775685,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189556.422857,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189557.238334,"samples":19337,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"close","t":199605.209607,"code":1005}]}